    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Export a campaign page to Drive\n1. Credentials: a Header Auth credential for the two **Figma** HTTP nodes (name `X-Figma-Token`, value your Figma token), and a Google Drive OAuth2 credential for every **Drive** node (the `Find …` and `Ensure …` HTTP nodes use it as a predefined credential, plus **Upload to Drive**).\n2. Set the default Drive root folder in the **Export form** trigger (field *Drive root folder URL*). It can still be overridden per run.\n3. Folders: root / year / `MM. Month` / `DD.MM.YYYY Campaign` / format. Files: `DDMM-LANG.jpg`.\nUploads go to *My Drive*. For a shared drive, pick it in **Upload to Drive**.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "b2f0c002-0000-4000-8000-000000000025",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1072,
        140
      ]
    }
